("v177", "key", "method")
("v178", "type", "String")
("v178", "scalar", "Algebra-owned lexical HTML scan with quote-aware tags and attributes; nonempty text and every attribute, including id are observed. Only exact element selector and property references are reconciled. No equality-based intent inference or ancestor/subtree coverage.")
("v177", "value", "v178")
("v85", "entry", "v179")
("v179", "type", "Entry")
("v179", "key", "boundary")
("v180", "type", "String")
("v180", "scalar", "This scans the five generated homepage documents, not every corpus destination or live DOM state. Comments, doctype and formatting whitespace are excluded. Inline script/style bodies and external script/stylesheet dependencies are opaque and remain undecided unless precisely declared. CSS internals, runtime-only states, shadow DOM, frames and semantic/visual fitness are not certified. Token ordinals are byte-rendering evidence addresses, not stable DOM paths.")
("v179", "value", "v180")
